1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,555
W: Did you see the list of activities taking place at the community center that was released today?

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:06,580
M: Not yet.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,900
Is there anything on there that looks interesting?

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,640
I'd love to do some fun activities this summer.

5
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:14,860
W: I'm thinking of taking part in the fishing contest.

6
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,940
Would you like to join me?

7
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,535
We can be on the same team.

8
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,210
M: Okay, that sounds good to me.

9
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,360
Do we have to pay a fee to enter?

10
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:31,925
W: I don't, because I'm a member of the community center, but since you don't belong to it, it will cost you $15 to enter.

11
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:38,335
M: Okay, I don't mind paying that amount of money.
